  "goodToKnow": "Umkreisen is inseparable, so the stress falls on the stem and there's no ge- in the participle: Der Satellit hat die Erde umkreist. The separable twin kreisen um also exists, but umkreisen is the standard choice for orbiting. Der Kreis is the circle, and der Umkreis is the surrounding area: im Umkreis von zehn Kilometern means within a ten-kilometre radius."
